===Format===
* '''Opening Stage:''' 
** Single-Elimination bracket
** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Winners advance to the '''Playoffs'''
** Losers proceed to the '''Resurrection Stage'''

* '''Resurrection Stage:''' 
** Single-Elimination bracket
** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
** Winner advances to the '''Playoffs'''

* '''Playoffs:''' 
** Single-Elimination bracket
** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}

